# First Roll: the first of our levels, made in the spirit of the original's first one (its order of lessons, its kinds
# of parts, its widths and its help; measured, not traced: the layout, turns, heights and lengths are ours). Four
# sectors: a wooden bridge, the first rails, boxes on a walled square, the stone transformer and
# back to wood, loose paper balls; a loop of rails, a long bridge, a dome, the stone on the crate (pushed out from under it from the
# floor below); a square of loose balls and two pushers (pushed out of their lane from the floor beside it), rails to
# the wood transformer; wooden ramps zigzagging up between railed landings and the long way down to the finish.
# Gutters along every floor; railings at the start, round the outer side of the turns, on the landings and where a
# floor below the way has a drop. Edit this file and run `scripts/own-levels.sh assets/levels/01_First_Roll`.
title First Roll
title.ru Первый разбег
title.de Erster Lauf
title.zh 初次滚动
order 1
sky Sunset
music 1
bonus 100
ball wood
columns 80

